  "details": "The Tracker's sphere are showing when in the game with no menu open and not calibrating. This happens at random time and they go away and come back randomly with no apparent reason. There is a way to almost always trigger that bug when you open the big menu at the same time as having your personal mirror On and close to you, then closing the menu make them stay shown for a good 5 minutes before disappearing again. Also sometimes when doing absolutely nothing they can pop up again then go away minutes later.",
